Date: Sat, 13 Jun 2026 21:57:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01682/11362] [outer-loop] lower decisive-graft gate 0.85->0.82
 per 2026-06-13 operator directive

The contiguous TRM Sudoku-Extreme run plateaued at val~0.82 (banked 0.8227),
converged within ~5pp of the published ~0.87. Operator decided 0.82 is a
faithful-enough baseline for the verifier-as-reward graft. exp4168 v1 already
ran+deferred at val~0.50; renamed to v2 (re-runs since pick_next_task matches by
title), gate 0.82, fresh-recompute preconditions from last.ckpt.bestval, new
deliverable path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
